## 7. Architecture Boundaries

This extension must:

- register its actions at package import time through the public
  `registerExtension()` API;
- use only public ggaction package entries;
- preserve `ChartProgram` immutability and meaningful action traces;
- keep action orchestration, pure domain calculations, and graphical
  materialization separate;
- explicitly materialize graphical changes made by domain actions;
- reuse existing ggaction actions, semantic resources, graphic primitives, and
  renderers whenever they already own the required behavior; and
- avoid modifying or recreating ggaction core behavior.

A feature that requires a new ggaction core API, graphic primitive, or renderer
must remain `draft` and record an open decision instead of implementing a local
workaround.

